n frames 4–14 and 29–30, the man in orange is talking to **Lee Chong Wei** (Malaysia), not Lin Dan. So he is **Lee Chong Wei’s coach**, not Lin Dan’s.\n\n---\n\n### Correction on Identity:\n\nActually, the man in orange is **Lee Chong Wei’s coach** — he is **Tey Seu Bock**, Lee’s long-time coach. Lin Dan’s coach (Li Yongbo) is not clearly visible in these frames interacting with Lin Dan — Lin Dan is seen with other team staff in red/blue, but not with the orange-clad man.\n\n---\n\n### Final Corrected Answer:\n\n> ❌ **The answer ‘1’ (Lin Dan’s coach) is incorrect.** The man in orange is **Lee Chong Wei’s coach**, and **he is not coughing** in any of the frames. Therefore, the answer fails both on identity (wrong coach) and behavior (no coughing observed).\n\n---\n\n✅ **Correct Answer Based on Frames: “That guy in orange” is Lee Chong Wei’s coach — and he is not coughing.**'}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3243.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3244.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3245.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3246.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3247.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3248.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3249.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3250.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3251.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3252.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3253.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3254.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3255.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Hf-n1yfd8II/frames/frame_3256.